WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=yo.

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.154
The Arclight ise agbese.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:05.633
Bawo ni a ṣe le yọ arun oju kuro nigbati o n pin awọn gilaasi oju?

3
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.850
Nigbati o ba n pin awọn gilaasi oju o ṣe pataki lati yọkuro arun oju miiran ti o wa labẹ.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.084
Pẹlu aworan acuity wiwo ati ẹrọ Arclight o le yara wa ẹniti o nilo

5
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:19.318
awọn gilaasi ati iru ati tani o le nilo itọkasi fun awọn arun miiran bii cataracts ati

6
00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:23.552
glaucoma.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:30.480
Bẹrẹ pẹlu idanwo acuity wiwo ijinna ti oju kan ni akoko kan laisi iranlọwọ ati ti o ba dinku lo pinhole kan.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.520
lẹhinna ṣe idanwo iran nitosi pẹlu awọn oju mejeeji papọ.

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.920
Nibẹ ni o wa ojo melo marun ṣee ṣe awọn iyọrisi.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.400
Ti ijinna ti o wa nitosi acuity wiwo jẹ mejeeji dara,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.780
alaisan ko nilo awọn gilaasi.

12
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.160
Ti iranran ijinna ba dinku,

13
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.920
ṣugbọn ilọsiwaju pẹlu pinhole ati iran ti o sunmọ dara,

14
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:53.360
lẹhinna alaisan naa jẹ oju kukuru diẹ diẹ, ti a tun mọ ni myopic.

15
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.920
Ti iranran ijinna ba dinku ṣugbọn o ni ilọsiwaju pẹlu pinhole,

16
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.920
ati iran ti o sunmọ tun dinku,

17
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.920
lẹhinna alaisan naa ṣee ṣe riran gigun,

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.920
tun mọ bi hyperopia.

19
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
Ti iranran ijinna ba dara,

20
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
ṣugbọn iran ti o sunmọ ti dinku,

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.920
ati pe alaisan naa ti ju ogoji ọdun lọ,

22
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.920
lẹhinna wọn ti tẹ bioopia ati nilo awọn gilaasi kika.

23
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.920
Nikẹhin, ti o ba dinku oju wiwo

24
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.920
ati pe ko ni ilọsiwaju pẹlu pinhole tabi awọn gilaasi,

25
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
lẹhinna arun oju ti o wa labẹ o ṣee ṣe pupọ,

26
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.778
alaisan nilo idanwo pẹlu ina arc.

27
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:33.270
Gbe lọ si yara ti o tan imọlẹ ki o bẹrẹ pẹlu taara

28
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.455
akẹẹkọ ina reflex.

29
00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:38.010
Mejeeji eniyan yẹ ki o constrict se ati briskly si imọlẹ.

30
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.590
Ti wọn ko ba ṣe bẹ

31
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.386
ni ihamọ daradara, o ṣee ṣe lati jẹ arun ti nafu ara tabi retina

32
00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.470
ni ẹhin

33
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.230
oju, gẹgẹbi glaucoma tabi iyọkuro retina.

34
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.422
Nigbamii ṣayẹwo idanwo ifasilẹ inawo.

35
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:54.710
Itumọ imudara alamimọ ti o ni imọlẹ tumọ si pe ko si ohun ti o dina

36
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.730
imọlẹ ti nwọ oju.

37
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.770
Ti ifasilẹ ba dinku tabi ko si, lẹhinna cataract, corneal

38
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:05.759
aleebu, ẹjẹ ni ẹhin oju tabi tumo, boya dina ina.

39
00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.090
Nigbamii ṣayẹwo iwaju

40
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.396
ti oju, sunmọ soke pẹlu lupu apa iwaju.

41
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.710
Wa fun eyikeyi ikolu corneal ati ogbe

42
00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.578
tabi cataract.

43
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:18.782
Ni ipari, ṣe optomoscopy taara ati wo ẹhin oju.

44
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:19.650
Xammon opiki

45
00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
nafu ati retina fun awọn ami ti glaucoma, retinopathy tairodu, aleebu ati retinal

46
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.203
iyapa.

47
00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:29.790
Ti eyikeyi arun ba wa tabi o tun ko le ṣiṣẹ jade idi ti

48
00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.050
iran alaisan jẹ mimọ, lẹhinna ṣe eto fun alaisan lati rii alamọja oju.

49
00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.090
Fidio yii ṣe afihan pe nipasẹ adaṣe pẹlu idamọran igbagbogbo,

50
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.530
awọn oṣiṣẹ ilera gbogbogbo, paapaa pẹlu awọn irinṣẹ idiyele kekere, le loye ti a

51
00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.610
alaisan yoo ni anfani lati awọn gilaasi oju tabi nilo itọkasi fun itọju ti abẹlẹ

52
00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.104
arun.

53
00:02:47.104 --> 00:02:53.530
Ilana ti o lagbara pẹlu ohun elo idiyele kekere kan nibikibi ni agbaye nipasẹ

54
00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.930
ẹnikẹni.
